*** Add File:security/n8n_security_recommendations.md
+# n8n Security & Hardening Recommendations
+
+1) Authentication: protect UI with OIDC/SSO; disable basic auth.
+2) Secrets: never store credentials in workflow node parameters; use Vault and inject short-lived tokens.
+3) Network: limit webhook endpoints and require HMAC signature validation for inbound triggers.
+4) RBAC: restrict workflow editing to automation owners and require review & git-based exports for change control.
+5) Backups: nightly DB backups + periodic workflow export to git.
+6) Monitoring: alerts for execution failure rates and suspicious spikes in webhook traffic.
+7) Runtime: run n8n behind a hardened ingress (WAF) and ensure TLS for all inbound/outbound connections.
+
